I am writing to apply for the *Front-End Engineering Internship* (onsite, Tokyo) in HENNGE's Global Internship Program. My preferred batch is *Batch 5 (Nov 16 – Dec 18, 2026)*, and I am ready to relocate from Bangladesh for the full five-week program.

